architecture household-economic-circuit
  canonical_name HouseholdEconomicCircuit
  family economic
  domain Economic / Cross-domain Household Comparison
  layer economic/household
  semantic_question Which current, source-bound housing recurring components and food route strategies can be compared without fabricating a residence join, a budget, or accounting truth?
  purpose Reads the existing housing effective-cost and food fulfillment projections, makes scenario-selected recurring and one-time component views, binds their input digests as evidence, and explicitly refuses a cross-domain total unless an explicit residence identity joins the inputs.
  maturity implemented
  owns HouseholdRecurringScenario
  owns HouseholdOneTimeComponentView
  owns HouseholdComparisonConstraint
  owns HouseholdProjectionEvidenceBundle
  owns RefusedResidenceJoin
  consumes FoodCombinationProjection
  consumes FinancialPosition
  consumes Evidence
  publishes HouseholdEconomicCircuitProjection
  node_types HouseholdRecurringScenario
  node_types HouseholdOneTimeComponentView
  node_types HouseholdComparisonConstraint
  node_types RefusedResidenceJoin
  edge_types scenario_selects
  edge_types evidence_binds
  edge_types refuses_unproven_join
  invariant optional pet and parking terms are scenario-selected and remain applicability-unverified unless an explicit source binds them to the selected unit
  invariant reported deposits and fees remain separately labelled and never imply refundability, money due, paid, billed or booked state
  invariant food component baskets and geodesic travel lower bounds remain separate from monthly food, driving and fuel projections
  invariant no cross-domain total exists without an explicit shared residence identity
  forbidden_inference candidate route origin -> residence, verified availability or lease
  forbidden_inference observed component basket -> meal, weekly or monthly food budget
  forbidden_inference geodesic lower bound -> driving distance, time, fuel or travel cost
  forbidden_inference cross-domain projection -> billed, paid, booked or spend-authorized accounting truth
  interacts food-combination-is-bounded-by-household-circuit
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/household_economic_circuit.py.archive
  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_household_economic_circuit.py.archive
  witness .bonfyre/run8-r2c/20260823T032652Z-27525/household/cross-domain/economic-circuit.json
  source_lineage Run8 cross-domain-household-circuit live food and housing comparison
  known_gap every source this entry names is archived, so nothing here is a live implementation a reader can open and run. Whether a native owner has taken this work over is not established in this entry; until one is named and witnessed here, the architecture stands on retired code.
